00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:17.757 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm literally.
- Bigger, better now.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:19.259
- It's good enough,

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:21.094
we literally just shot a
campaign ad in cinema mode

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.495
on iPhone 13 pro,

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:23.896 align:start size:75% position:25%
and I was like.
- Oh, wow.

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.365 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Holy shit, this is actually
a really good camera.

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.600 align:start size:97% position:3%
So there's some innovation,
but it's also marginal.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Mm-hmm.
- And this is all confined

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:32.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
to sort of your smartphone
