00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:33.706
or software startups,

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:36.909 align:start size:97% position:3%
actually society looks so
much like it did in the 1970s,

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:38.144
like we're not moving faster,

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:39.679 align:start size:81% position:19%
in some ways we're
moving slower.

00:04:39.679 --> 00:04:41.714 align:start size:88% position:13%
You know, we don't
build houses any better

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.416
or more efficiently now.

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:45.318
Actually housing prices are
just going through the roof,

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:47.520
right, so, so much in
our society is stagnant

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.656
and Zero to One is yeah,
narrowly a business book,

00:04:49.656 --> 00:04:53.793
but broadly it's the sort of
exploration of why is so much

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.862
