00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:10.910
it was like, I didn't really
wanna be a politician at first,

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.612
but somebody's got to fix this.

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:13.746
- Somebody's gotta fix this,

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:14.947 align:start size:84% position:16%
yeah.
- And I'm somebody?

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.482
- I definitely have
that view of it.

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:18.451
I mean, I'm getting into it,

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:20.553 align:start size:97% position:3%
I really wanna get into
it, I think it's important.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:23.589 align:start size:84% position:16%
You know, I'm loving
campaigning, I'm
gonna win the race.

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
So on Monday.
- You just told everybody.

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:26.793
- You just told everyone,
so that's gonna happen.

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.227
- You're right, you're golden.

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:30.596 align:start position:0%
- But it'd be nice in some
sense, like if I didn't have to,

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:31.864
like, if things were working,

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:33.099
if we didn't have
this establishment

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.635 align:start size:88% position:13%
