new thinking in government.

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:45.745 align:start position:0%
So it's also the most important
thing I could be doing.

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:47.880
I didn't think this was
the case in like 2012

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.483 align:start size:88% position:13%
