00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:09.235 align:start size:84% position:16%
and just sort of
failed to understand

00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:12.071
this was a fight for the future
of the country, and he lost.

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:16.242
And to me, I was always been
political, but it's sorta like,

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:18.211 align:start size:88% position:13%
well, if the, if the
right, if conservatives,

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:21.147 align:start position:0%
if Republicans just aren't
gonna be serious about winning,

00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:23.750
maybe it's just the
controlled opposition

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.319
