managed decline politically

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:28.287
and that's why I wanted
to go into business.

00:06:28.287 --> 00:06:30.456 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's like I could
actually do something.

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:33.459 align:start size:84% position:16%
You could start in and
invest in startups.

00:06:33.459 --> 00:06:36.629 align:start size:97% position:3%
