retard progress,

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:40.900
then maybe we can
have a good future.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.970 align:start size:88% position:13%
So, I basically thought
it was all over,

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.639
honestly until 2016 and
Trump comes on the scene

00:06:46.639 --> 00:06:48.441 align:start size:84% position:16%
